{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Core Miners</i>, you\u2019ll step into the role of a mine manager, leading a team of miners from the earth\u2019s surface all the way down to the deep underground. Every level is filled with abundant ores and unknown treasures waiting for you to unearth\u2014rare ores even let you strike it rich overnight! There\u2019s no need to stay glued to the screen: the game supports offline earnings. The longer you\u2019re offline, the harder your miners work, and the more gold they accumulate for you. When you return, you\u2019ll be greeted with a pleasant surprise, truly enabling effortless AFK (away-from-keyboard) play and continuous progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dig deeper into the mine, new miners and mysterious ores will unlock one after another, bringing fresh strategies and fun. Unlock powerful equipment, upgrade your miner team, and build your very own mining empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig infinitely deep, with surprises at every level\u2014rare ores are waiting for you to mine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AFK offline, harvest easily, and say goodbye to grind-heavy gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse miners with unique skills\u2014you\u2019re in control of their strategic combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up and play, for the ultimate relaxing mining experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download the game now and embark on your legendary mining journey!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Descent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2644280/a3fcb33135e3287edbaa6eee8eefe43d7762ac8c.jpg"},{"name":"Going Deeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2644280/0f0b5f1f1576f4ff7ab17ef3d1c365d977805431.jpg"},{"name":"Cave Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2644280/7c1dfc91808ba0b32